i-111-wei-huo:p008","start":135,"end":139,"surface":"上谷太守","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:m008-0139","usage":"narrative","date_expression":"是歲也","normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":123,"year":-122,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"是歲也，大將軍姊子霍去病年十八，幸，為天子侍中。善騎射，再從大將軍，受詔與壯士，為剽姚校尉，與輕勇騎八百直棄大軍數百里赴利，斬捕首虜過當。於是天子曰：「剽姚校尉去病斬首虜二千二十八級，及相國、當戶，斬單于大父行籍若侯產，生捕季父羅姑比，再冠軍，以千六百戶封去病為冠軍侯。上谷太守郝賢四從大將軍，捕斬首虜二千餘人，以千一百戶封賢為眾利侯。」是歲，失兩將軍軍，亡翕侯，軍功不多，故大將軍不益封。右將軍建至，天子不誅，赦其罪，贖為庶人。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p008","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/111.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p007","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/111.json"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p006","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/111.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《史記》前段紀年承接","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷111&oldid=8730225","quote":"元朔之五年春，漢令車騎將軍青將三萬騎","scope":"received_relative_year_anchor","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"是歲也承第7段其明年春，而第7段承第6段元朔五年，暫前123年；僅年精度，年十八不反推出生年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本年用稱與明示授任／封侯／贖為庶人分開；未明任期端點保持未知，不因失將或死亡截斷全部官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji111-090","person_id":"ldw_cby_hek","title":"眾利侯","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo","source_id":"s-shiji111-wei-huo","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p008","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/111.json"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji111-090:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p008","start":164,"end":1